+// device-owned buffer for grid-wide sync of persistent kernels:
+// uint32 [0, 2*GGML_METAL_SYNC_SLOTS) = (arrive, exit) counter pairs, [GGML_METAL_SYNC_ERR_IDX] = spin timeout flag,
